Enterprise Scenario

Your pipeline fails because someone committed:

terraform.tfvars

containing secrets.

Fix:

git rm --cached terraform.tfvars

Add to .gitignore:

terraform.tfvars

Commit:

git commit -m "Remove sensitive file from tracking"

Rotate the exposed secrets immediately because they may already have been compromised.

